sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Q as Query / turn
    participant G as Intent gate<br/>(small LLM)
    participant R as Source router
    participant SA as Search agents x3<br/>(concurrent LLM tool-loops)
    participant S as Stores T G D<br/>+ raw A
    participant I as Integrator (LLM)

    Q->>G: user query
    alt self-contained
        G-->>Q: pass straight through - zero added latency
    else needs memory
        G->>R: route (restrict which stores may be touched)
        R->>SA: dispatch
        par timeline search
            SA->>S: hybrid retrieval (embedding + lexical, RRF k=60),<br/>filters: time window / tag / source / speaker
            SA->>S: open raw chunks in A on demand
        and graph search
            SA->>S: walk entity-event edges in G
            SA->>S: open raw chunks on demand
        and documentary search
            SA->>S: hybrid retrieval over D HDM
            SA->>S: open L2 full text on demand
        end
        Note over SA,S: rerank SKIPPED for temporal queries<br/>O = the set of evidence actually OPENED
        SA->>I: per-store grounded results + O
        alt O is empty
            I-->>Q: ABSTAIN - "I don't know" (citation lock: C subset of O)
        else
            I-->>Q: ONE merged answer, citations C subset of O,<br/>single confidence score
        end
    end
